# Live Scores: idle through refreshes, monitor a game through a real score change, focus and row kept.
w 0.5
x
w 15
n t
w 3
q {DOWN}
w 1
k {DOWN}
w 3
k {DOWN}
w 3
k {DOWN}
w 3
# Two and a half minutes idle at the 1-minute default: does NVDA speak? is the row kept?
k {DOWN}
w 150
n {UP}
w 4
# Monitor this game
k %m
w 5
n {UP}
w 4
# Wait through refreshes and likely score changes
k {DOWN}
w 2
k {UP}
w 200
n {UP}
w 4
k %m
w 5
n {UP}
w 4
# Refresh by hand
k {F5}
w 10
n {UP}
w 4
n {TAB}
w 3
# Tab around, change frequency to 30 seconds if offered
k {TAB}
w 2.5
k {TAB}
w 2.5
k {TAB}
w 2.5
k {TAB}
w 2.5
k +{TAB}
w 2.5
k +{TAB}
w 2.5
k +{TAB}
w 2.5
k +{TAB}
w 2.5
# Open a live game, come back
k {ENTER}
w 12
n t
w 3
k {ESC}
w 10
n {UP}
w 4
n t
w 3
